  "title": "Adds rejected status for Accounts v2 capabilities",
  "summary": "Adds a rejected value to the status property of account capabilities on Accounts v2. This status appears alongside the existing values active, pending, restricted, and unsupported. Previously, rejected accounts provided a status of restricted with a status_details code of requirements_past_due.",
